     A**
     A** WCMS Medata Claims Eligibility File

     A*****************************************************************
     A****                                                         ****
     A****  This file is extracted from WCMS claims selecting      ****
     A****  all open claims. It will be used by Medata to          ****
     A****  determine whether a Claimant's monthly prescriptions   ****
     A****  are for their Injury, or other medical issues outside  ****
     A****  of the On the Job Injury and/or WC Coverage.           ****
     A****                                                         ****
     H*****************************************************************
     H*  CREATED:                                                     *
     H*  10/27/05  C:163  PROJECT: 136MBR                             *
     H*                   Managed Care/Prov Bill Interface Process    *
     H*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A*  REVISIONS:                                                   *
     A*                                                               *
     A*  06/20/16   C:309   Project: 136MHB                           *
     A*                     Added a new field CEJCN                   *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************

     A          R PCE01                     TEXT('WCMS Employer Transfer File')
     A            CECLM#        15A         COLHDG('Claim' 'Number')
     A            CECLDT         8S 0       COLHDG('Close' 'Date of' 'Claim')
     A            CEACDT         8S 0       COLHDG('Accident' 'Date')
     A            CELSN         30A         COLHDG('Claimant' 'Last' 'Name')
     A            CEFSN         15A         COLHDG('Claimant' 'First' 'Name')
     A            CESS#          9A         COLHDG('Claimant' 'SS#')
     A            CECONO         8A         COLHDG('Company' 'Number')
     A            CEDOB          8S 0       COLHDG('Birth' 'Date')
     A            CESEX          1A         COLHDG('Sex')
     A            CEHIDT         8S 0       COLHDG('Hire' 'Date')
     A            CEJRST         2A         COLHDG('Jurisdiction' 'State')
     A            CECOV          2A         COLHDG('Coverage')
     A*** Beg Add *** 06/20/16 ****************************************
     A            CEJCN         25A         COLHDG('Jurisdiction' 'Claim +
     A                                      Number')
     A*** End Add *** 06/20/16 ****************************************
